  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is a lost soul, bound to the mortal world by undying anger or a bitter grudge. Most phantom eidolons are humanoids with a spectral or ectoplasmic appearance, though some take far stranger forms. Your link with your eidolon prevents them from succumbing to corruption and undeath. Together, you will need to decide whether to work with your eidolon to control their anger or channel their wrath into power.</p><p><strong>Tradition</strong> occult</p><p><strong>Traits</strong> eidolon, ethereal, phantom</p><p><strong>Home Plane</strong> Ethereal Plane</p><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium or Small</p><p><strong>Suggested Attacks</strong> fist (bludgeoning), tendril (bludgeoning), unarmed attacks shaped like a weapon </p><p><strong>Eidolon Attributes</strong> Con +3, Int +0, Wis –1, Cha +1</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Intimidation, Occultism</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> darkvision</p><p><strong>Language</strong> one common mortal language the eidolon spoke in life</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 25 feet</p><p><strong>Eidolon Abilities</strong> Initial @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.Item.CBJrHjIETQsh3OG6]{Furious Strike}; Symbiosis @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.MzqIc3XmAUQVdSFO]{Seething Frenzy}; Transcendence @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.MET0PzSNfpxi0D3E]{Anger Aura}</p>"
    },
